    <decisions>
        <name>Check_Count</name>
        <label>Check Count</label>
        <locationX>1172</locationX>
        <locationY>984</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Nothing to reassign</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Tem_Reasignados</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>varCount</leftValueReference>
                <operator>GreaterThan</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <numberValue>0.0</numberValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Update_Inactivos</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Has reassigned</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>Queue_Found</name>
        <label>Queue Found</label>
        <locationX>1799</locationX>
        <locationY>468</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Log_Sem_Fila</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No queue (placeholder)</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Tem_Fila</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_Queue</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Inactivos</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Has queue</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>Tem_Gerente</name>
        <label>Has Manager</label>
        <locationX>446</locationX>
        <locationY>1716</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>No manager (exit)</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Ha_Gerente</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>varMgrCount</leftValueReference>
                <operator>GreaterThan</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <numberValue>0.0</numberValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_NotifType</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Has manager</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>US-031 Phase 2: daily scheduled sweep (06:30 UTC) that reassigns to the escalation queue the Leads in &quot;En contacto&quot; status with no activity in the last 24h (LastGestionDate__c &lt; now-1d).
For each overdue lead: sets OwnerId to the queue defined in Lead_SLA_Config__mdt.EscalationQueueDevName__c (Default_Bandeja record), sets Rating=Hot, increments SLAReassignCount__c, stores the previous consultant in TransferredFromOnlineConsultant__c and stamps TransferDate__c and LastGestionDate__c. At the end it sends a Custom Notification (&quot;Lead_SLA_Alert&quot;) to the users of the management profile.
Bulk pattern: builds the collection inside the loop and runs a single Update DML outside the loop. Every Get/Update/action has a fault path to Log_Falha; if the escalation queue is not configured, it logs an advisory Task (Log_Sem_Fila) without reassigning.
Dependencies: Lead_SLA_Config__mdt CMDT and the Lead_SLA_Alert Custom Notification Type. Applies to all countries (Core model).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>bodyMsg</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Se reasignaron &quot; &amp; TEXT({!varCount}) &amp; &quot; lead(s) a la bandeja por inactividad de 24h. Revise la cola y la reasignacion.&quot;</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>contadorInact</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression>BLANKVALUE({!Loop_Inactivos.SLAReassignCount__c}, 0) + 1</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>cutoffDt</name>
        <dataType>DateTime</dataType>
        <expression>{!$Flow.CurrentDateTime} - 1</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>prevConsultorInact</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>IF(BEGINS({!Loop_Inactivos.OwnerId}, &quot;005&quot;), {!Loop_Inactivos.OwnerId}, &quot;&quot;)</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Lead_Scheduled_ReassignInactive {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Lead_Scheduled_ReassignInactive</label>
    <loops>
        <name>Loop_Inactivos</name>
        <label>Loop Inactive Leads</label>
        <locationX>1172</locationX>
        <locationY>684</locationY>
        <collectionReference>Get_Inactivos</collectionReference>
        <iterationOrder>Asc</iterationOrder>
        <nextValueConnector>
